ietly-kill-off-the-vma-for-best-rock-video/</guid></item><item><title>马修·麦康纳 (Matthew McConaughey) 在这张 1993 年的热门歌曲（播放超过 20 次）的帮助下戒掉了大麻</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/matthew-mcconaughey-quit-smoking-weed-with-the-help-of-this-1993-smash-hit-played-over-20-times/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;如果您正在玩《六度分离》，您可以通过一个发人深省的戒烟故事将珍妮·杰克逊和马修·麦康纳联系起来。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/matthew-mcconaughey-quit-smoking-weed-with-the-help-of-this-1993-smash-hit-played-over-20-times/"&gt;马修·麦康纳 (Matthew McConaughey) 借助这首 1993 年的热门歌曲（播放了 20 多次）戒掉了大麻，&lt;/a&gt;该帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 19:49:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/matthew-mcconaughey-quit-smoking-weed-with-the-help-of-this-1993-smash-hit-played-over-20-times/</guid></item><item><title>《忍者神龟乱斗者》大更新中添加新的可玩角色</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles-brawler-adds-new-playable-character-in-huge-update/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;《忍者神龟》粉丝现在可以获得一个新的 DLC，让他们能够与敌人战斗并解决 Slash 的新内容。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles-brawler-adds-new-playable-character-in-huge-update/"&gt;《忍者神龟 Brawler》在大型更新中添加新的可玩角色的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 18:52:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles-brawler-adds-new-playable-character-in-huge-update/</guid></item></channel></rss>